{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104468","id":2410967411,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PtHFz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104468","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104468.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104468.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104468","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104468/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104468/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104468/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c9806a03e78c07edb6039cf810040fcd7672bc0b","number":104468,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add optional UID comments for GDScript","user":{"login":"LezLiz","id":146664640,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL3swA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146664640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz","html_url":"https://github.com/LezLiz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LezLiz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Alternative to #99090\r\nInspired by the [UID feedback discussion](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/11574)\r\n\r\nAllows one to optionally specify the UID of a GDScript file with a first line comment. This PR is a minimalist approach that intends to keep things simple in the engine while allowing users do the rest with editor plugins or such. I have coded such a plugin for myself to test this, and I'm quite happy with the approach.\r\n\r\nThe UID of a GDScript is determined in the following way if this PR is merged:\r\n\r\n1. If a GDScript file has a corresponding UID file, then the UID file is used just like before. This keeps things smooth and backwards compatible for users who are happy with UID files.\r\n2. If the first line of the GDScript file contains a valid UID comment of form `# uid://abcd`, then the UID in the comment is used and no UID file is generated.\r\n3. Otherwise, a new UID file is generated and used just like before.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-03-22T04:23:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-23T19:32:35Z","closed_at":"2025-03-23T19:31:42Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"13